course: dictionary
lesson: 3103
title: Eighth: order and parts
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Eighth means number 8 in order, coming after seventh. In the old Roman calendar, «October (oct = 8) the eighth» month, so eighth tells you the position in a list.
explain: An eighth is one of eight equal parts of something. «A grown-up's head is only about an eighth of their height.» If you split a person's height into eight equal pieces, the head is about one of them.
explain: Picture a pizza cut into 8 equal slices. Each slice is an eighth, written 1/8. Two slices are two eighths, and two eighths make a quarter. Eight eighths make one whole pizza.
explain: Check which meaning fits. If the word tells you where something comes in a line, it means order. If it names one of eight equal pieces, it means a fraction.
fact: Eighth is an ordinal number: it tells the position, like first, second and third.
fact: An eighth is written 1/8 and is one of eight equal parts.
fact: 1/8 = 0.125 = 12.5%.
fact: Two eighths equal one quarter, and eight eighths make one whole.
fact: In music, an eighth note (US) is called a quaver (UK).
exercise: «In the old Roman calendar, October (oct = 8) was the eighth month.» Which month was the eighth? | *October | September | December | November
exercise: A pizza is cut into 8 equal slices. What is one slice? | A quarter | A half | Eight eighths | *An eighth
exercise: What is 1/8 as a percentage? | 1.8% | 8% | 18% | *12.5%
test: Ella came eighth in the race. What does eighth tell you? | She won the race | She ran eight miles | *Her place in order: 8th | She was eight years old
test: Two eighths of a cake make how much of the cake? | A whole cake | Three eighths | An eighth | *A quarter
exam: Which sentence uses eighth to mean one of eight equal parts? | It was his eighth birthday | *A grown-up's head is about an eighth of their height | She lives on the eighth floor | Ben came eighth in the race
